ending state settled by a later action, and actual target blockage. No rollback guarantee is introduced.","minimal_fix":"Describe state 1 as written only after execution/PP gates and usage bookkeeping reach its producer. Describe state 2 as completion of the target-processing branch, including zero affected targets, rather than requiring actual success. Qualify settlement to currently nonfainted battlers. Keep the direct state-to-skill table, explicitly restricting protected preservation to state 1; add a live Protect counterexample.","proposed_clean_room_wording":"处理进入目标阶段并走到该阶段末尾时会写入完成状态，即使全部目标被保护或未命中；有目标时，相性只合计未被判无效的目标，全部排除则合计为0。完成状态按相性赋值技槽，合计0赋−2；保护标记只在仍处于失败状态时使技槽保持。结算只处理当前存在且尚未倒下的战斗者。前置资格或PP失败尚未到写入失败状态的时点。","dependencies_and_sync_files":["deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp56-palace-and-arena-variants.md","deliverables/final-specification-set/test-catalog/combat-requirements-wp54-55-56-58.md","audit/source-traceability.md (batch 13)","planning/feature-matrix.md (WP56 row)","WP40/WP43 execution and protection cross-reference; revise only if duplicated language is found"],"tests":["Living Tackle against successful Protect: slot 0→-2; damage remains 0.","Normal unprotected nonimmune hit: slot 0→+1.","Direct state1/protected=true fixture preserves prior skill, without presenting it as ordinary Protect behavior.","Settlement excludes an already fainted battler; last-action early whole-move failure retains prior skill, whereas a later eligible settlement may consume its pending state."],"status":"PROPOSAL_COUNTERCHECK_COMPLETE_AWAITING_ROOT_I_CLASSIFICATION","verification":"Static semantic derivation; no reference execution or runtime test.","original_id":"GR6-F-V001","origin_artifact":"variants/findings.json","non_proposer_countercheck":"counterchecks-variants.json","root_verdict":"PENDING_ROOT_I","logical_primary":"R6-F","formal_denominator_links":[{"path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp56-palace-and-arena-varian